  "@howToPrayTransTakbir": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransTakbir"
  },
  "howToPrayTransOpeningDua": "赞美你，真主啊，以你的赞美；你的名字是吉祥的，你的尊严是崇高的，除你之外无真主。",
  "@howToPrayTransOpeningDua": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransOpeningDua"
  },
  "howToPrayTransFatiha": "以至仁至慈的真主之名。一切赞美归真主，全世界的主。至仁至慈的主。报应日的主。我们只崇拜你，只向你求助。求你引导我们走上正路——你所赐恩典的人们的路，不是那些受谴怒的人的路，也不是那些迷途的人的路。",
  "@howToPrayTransFatiha": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransFatiha"
  },
  "howToPrayTransRuku": "赞美我的伟大之主",
  "@howToPrayTransRuku": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransRuku"
  },
  "howToPrayTransItidal": "真主倾听赞美祂之人。我们的主，一切赞美归于你。",
  "@howToPrayTransItidal": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransItidal"
  },
  "howToPrayTransSujood": "赞美我的至高之主",
  "@howToPrayTransSujood": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransSujood"
  },
  "howToPrayTransJalsa": "我的主，求你饶恕我",
  "@howToPrayTransJalsa": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransJalsa"
  },
  "howToPrayTransTashahhud": "一切问候、祈祷和美言都属于真主。愿真主赐平安给你，先知啊，以及祂的慈悯与祝福。愿真主赐平安给我们和祂的虔诚仆人。我作证除真主外无神，我作证穆罕默德是祂的仆人和使者。",
  "@howToPrayTransTashahhud": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransTashahhud"
  },
  "howToPrayTransSalawat": "真主啊，求你赐福于穆罕默德及其家人，犹如你赐福于易卜拉欣及其家人——你确是值得赞美的、尊贵的。真主啊，求你赐恩于穆罕默德及其家人，犹如你赐恩于易卜拉欣及其家人——你确是值得赞美的、尊贵的。",
  "@howToPrayTransSalawat": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransSalawat"
  },
  "howToPrayTransTasleem": "愿平安与真主的慈悯降于你们",
  "@howToPrayTransTasleem": {
    "description": "howToPrayTransTasleem"
  },
  "howToPrayOpeningDuaInstruction": "在开场大赞词之后，轻声诵读此祈祷词。仅在礼拜开始时诵读一次。",
  "@howToPrayOpeningDuaInstruction": {
    "description": "howToPrayOpeningDuaInstruction"
  },
  "howToPraySurahInstruction": "法提哈之后，诵读你记住的任何章节。以哈斯章（如上）非常适合初学者——仅在前两拜诵读。",
  "@howToPraySurahInstruction": {
    "description": "howToPraySurahInstruction"
  },
  "howToPrayItidalInstruction": "起身时念'萨米阿拉呼',起立后念'拉巴那瓦拉卡勒罕'。",
  "@howToPrayItidalInstruction": {
    "description": "howToPrayItidalInstruction"
  },
  "howToPrayMiddleTashahhudInstruction": "第二拜后坐下，念作证词时举起右手食指。三拜和四拜礼拜中，此后将再次起立。",
  "@howToPrayMiddleTashahhudInstruction": {
    "description": "howToPrayMiddleTashahhudInstruction"
  },
  "howToPraySalawatInstruction": "在最后的作证词之后，仅在最后一次坐中，道萨拉姆之前，诵读祈祷词。",
  "@howToPraySalawatInstruction": {
    "description": "howToPraySalawatInstruction"
  },
  "howToPrayTasleemInstruction": "头转向右边，诵读萨拉姆，再转向左边重复。您的礼拜已完成。",
  "@howToPrayTasleemInstruction": {
